  "id": "interactive-advertising",
  "term": "interactive advertising",
  "definition": "Interactive advertising is advertising designed so people actively engage with the content rather than only view it passively. In the source packet, this involves augmented-reality ads that respond to a user’s position and hand gestures to show different videos or images.",
